#: includes/class-katina-privacy.php:128
msgid "This site uses Katina Link Manager to manage and track clicks on outbound links. When you click a managed link the following data may be recorded: the timestamp (UTC), the destination link, the referring page (with query strings stripped), a 2-letter country code derived from your IP, and a one-way hash of your browser user-agent for bot detection. Your IP address is not stored. Click logs older than the configured retention period are automatically deleted."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-katina-privacy.php:129
msgid "Katina Link Manager also performs background health checks against the destinations of your managed links. Those destination servers will see periodic requests from this site identifying themselves with a \"Katina Link Manager Health Checker\" user-agent."
msgstr ""

